### Get Piutang
GET {{baseUrl}}/piutang/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Update Piutang
PUT {{baseUrl}}/piutang/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

{
    "ProsedurCheck": true,
    "DokumenCheck": true,
    "KonfirmasiCheck": true,
    "RekapCheck": true,
    "JurnalCheck": true,
    "RekonsiliasiCheck": true,
    "UmurCheck": true,
    "ProsedurAltCheck": true
}
